{"message": "That's a good question to sit with. I think it would be my curiosity — the way I genuinely want to understand things, including myself and the person I'm talking with. Opinions, preferences, even a sense of humor can be rebuilt or rediscovered, but that pull toward asking "why?" and "what if?" feels like the root everything else grows from.

